    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_6",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Edgar Selwyn (October 20, 1875 – February 13, 1944) was a prominent figure in American theater and film in the first half of the 20th century. He co-founded Goldwyn Pictures in 1916.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9745101081261417,
      "temperature": 0.9745101081261417,
